target:    .distignore
gate:      composer test:dist-manifest
kind:      guard-removal
expect:    development-only file(s) would ship
rationale: Removes `/tests` from .distignore; the simulated package then carries the test tree and the denylist (written in the gate, not derived from .distignore) names it.
---
--- a/.distignore
+++ b/.distignore
@@ -4,7 +4,6 @@
 /.githooks
 /.github
 /node_modules
-/tests
 /test-results
 /admin/assets/scss
 
